      "name": "Itaipu Dam",
      "writeup": "One of the world's largest hydroelectric dams, located on the Paran\u00e1 River between Paraguay and Brazil.",
      "wiki": {
        "extract": "The Itaipu Dam is a hydroelectric dam on the Paran\u00e1 River located on the border between Brazil and Paraguay. It is the third-largest hydroelectric dam in the world in terms of produced energy.",
